    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f9217010711d67a4e7d3847",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "理所当然，\n美浦波旁当鬼，我会立刻被抓到；\n相反地，若我当鬼，就无法抓到她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "57be7ba2c432502bf0a1d5e40b0069f62e83b4aab92e43a44538abe80b8ee872",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026702.json",
