      "uid": "zhcn:8529af23f316b4325f9a8efe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是一个结局相当明了的鬼抓人。\n虽不能说绝对，\n但应该是没办法成为“重要的回忆”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef1d37b6ca40778bd9ae0fff46c7b831d13276aff361b3f187dadcfb045814ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
